            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For thus says the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ": “If those who did not deserve to drink the cup must drink it, will you go unpunished? You shall not go unpunished, but you must drink. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For I have sworn by myself, says the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", that Bozrah shall become a horror, a taunt, a waste, and a curse; and all her cities shall be perpetual wastes.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Edom shall become a horror; every one who passes by it will be horrified and will hiss because of all its disasters. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As when Sodom and Gomorrah and their neighbor cities were overthrown, says the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", no man shall dwell there, no man shall sojourn in her. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Behold, like a lion coming up from the jungle of the Jordan against a strong sheepfold, I will suddenly make them",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49.19",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Gk Syr: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "him",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " run away from her; and I will appoint over her whomever I choose. For who is like me? Who will summon me? What shepherd can stand before me? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore hear the plan which the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has made against Edom and the purposes which he has formed against the inhabitants of Teman: Even the little ones of the flock shall be dragged away; surely their fold shall be appalled at their fate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "At the sound of their fall the earth shall tremble; the sound of their cry shall be heard at the Red Sea. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Behold, one shall mount up and fly swiftly like an eagle, and spread his wings against Bozrah, and the heart of the warriors of Edom shall be in that day like the heart of a woman in her pangs.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
